# cursorx (Phase 6h, real time, CURSTAT build): the mouse circles over the animated areas while the
# screens update; at each shot ms_verify compares the planar screen with the shadow converted again
# (tools/curstat.py: 'debris' must be 0 - a stale save-under or a cursor drawn over a line being
# converted would show there; build with -DSCR_MAX=32768: the script is long). Bridge, system view (orbits, panel), damage control, star map.
# (the mouse stays above y 90: there the ST script stalls in the system view - see m49)
# vbls 16000
